WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.733
Schedule work, assign crews, move it (rain days).

00:00:04.433 --> 00:00:11.100
Waiting to be scheduled. Every sold piece of work waits here until it has a crew and a start day.

00:00:11.600 --> 00:00:20.900
Drag it onto a crew. Drag it onto a crew's start day (or click it, then the day). The days come from the crew-hours ÷ the crew size.

00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:30.167
Move it any time. Drag a block to another day or crew; a multi-day job moves together. A lock means it waits on a permit.

00:00:30.667 --> 00:00:34.000
Month view. The whole month, coloured by crew.

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:40.633
What the colours mean. Each job its own colour on the board; each crew its own colour in the month.

00:00:41.133 --> 00:00:46.733
That's it. You can play this tour in the app any time: press Help, and ask in your own words.
